      "string_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "You seen any soldiers around?",
      "JA_current": "この辺で兵隊を見なかったか？",
      "JA_new": "この辺で兵隊を見なかったか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_radar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_radar:rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_10#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_radar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_radar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 45,
      "string_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_10",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No, I ain't seen any soldiers for a long time.",
      "JA_current": "いいや、長い間兵隊は見てないな。",
      "JA_new": "いや、兵隊ならしばらく見てねえな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "10",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_radar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_radar:rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_100#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_radar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_radar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 48,
      "string_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_100",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "What about military stalkers?",
      "JA_current": "軍のストーカーはどうだ？",
      "JA_new": "ミリタリーの連中は？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "100",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_radar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_radar:rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_20#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_radar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_radar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 51,
      "string_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_20",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Rumor has it that they showed up right by the Radar, by the antennae! When they were turned off many people went to the Radar and further into Pripyat! We've been here for a day and we haven't seen anyone. Someone probably blocked the road here.",
      "JA_current": "噂によれば、奴らはアンテナの近くの、Red Forest の側に出現した。彼らがそれをオフにしたとき、沢山の人々が Red Forest に、そしてより遠い Pripyat まで殺到したらしい！ 俺たちは一日中ここに居たが、誰一人見なかったな。多分誰かがここの道路を塞いだんだろう。",
      "JA_new": "ミリタリーの連中なら、レーダーのアンテナ付近に現れたって噂だ。ブレイン・スコーチャーが止められてから、大勢がレーダーへ、さらにプリピャチへ向かったらしい。俺たちはここに一日いるが、誰にも会ってない。誰かがこの道を封鎖したんだろう。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "20",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_radar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_radar:rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_200#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_radar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_radar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 54,
      "string_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_200",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "You think the military blocked the road to the Radar?",
      "JA_current": "Red Forestへの道を塞いでるのは Military だと思ってるのかい？",
      "JA_new": "ミリタリーがレーダーへの道を封鎖したと思うか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "200",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_radar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_radar:rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_30#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_radar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_radar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 57,
      "string_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_30",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I don't think it was the military, I haven't seen any for a long time but military stalkers could have done it! They don't waste any time. They're the no-nonsense types, they work quickly and efficiently in their teams or solo... it's weird that they didn't block the road here earlier.",
      "JA_current": "俺は Military じゃないと思うね。ここじゃ長い間あいつらを見かけてないし Military はいつでも迅速正確に仕事をこなす… もっと早いうちに道路を封鎖しないのはMilitaryの仕業にしちゃ奇妙だ。",
      "JA_new": "ミリタリーじゃないと思う。しばらく姿を見てないからな。だが、ミリタリーの連中ならやりかねない！ あいつらは手が早い。チームでも単独でも、無駄なく手際よく動く……それにしても、もっと早くここを封鎖しててもよかったはずだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "30",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_radar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_radar:rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_300#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_radar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_radar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 60,
      "string_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_300",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Why did they not go to Pripyat or block the road there?",
      "JA_current": "なんで奴らは Pripyat に行かずに、ここで通せんぼしてたんだろう？",
      "JA_new": "なぜプリピャチへ行かなかった？ 向こうの道を封鎖もしなかった？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "300",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_radar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_radar:rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_40#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_radar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_radar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 63,
      "string_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3_40",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I don't know. Maybe they're afraid or they're getting ready for something. I can only guess.",
      "JA_current": "俺が知るかよ。多分奴らは何か恐れてるのか何かに備えてるんじゃないかな？",
      "JA_new": "さあな。怖がってるのか、何か準備してるのか。俺には分からん。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "rad_find_stalkers_dialog_3",
          "phrase_id": "40",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_radar.xml"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
